Z||000000||Slammed Fiero||07-31-2001||08:57 PM||||I haven't been here long , and I don't know if this has been a long time problem , but has anyone else noticed an increase in Trouble makers on the forum?? (Just to clairify this does not pertain to the GTA show thread)<P>I just saw a post about fiero people having to watch themselves about making MR2 comments. I searched the forum and got a very "teenage" like vibe from the person posting it. Then there's the current threat of the whole lesbian thing where someobne wants to see pics of Fiero lisa and other women of the forum. Again a Teenage like Vibe Came up , the grammar is very poor , as is the level of intelligence the person convey's. This is not to say All teenagers act this way , infact I have found most of them on the forum to be an asset to the growing hobby of Fiero-ing. There is another instance where 4 different members slader Japenese cars , all quote song lyrics from the same band , and all partake in the same outdoor activity , that is popular amongst male teenagers.<P>I get the feeling there is One person behind all of this. It's not even Funny like the posts about putting NOS on a 2m4 , and the guy offering Lisa Bus tickets to his trailer. It is offensive and of no real use to anyone. We all dump our BS in the Totally Off topic section , or as it should be called the gutter.. it's a place to laugh at others , and support them in times of need with the loss of love ones or hard times in their life.<P>Sorry just venting.. I too have a second forum name , I started to use it when someone was hasseling me on the forum , saying things about me for personal reasons , and basically who my GF was at the time. I used the name to get away from an identity and to keep ties with the Fiero world , I never used it to suport my own claims or sell products.<P>I guess i'm just frustrated with the state of the forum , there seems to be a lot of BS going down in some threads...you can say don't read it all you want , but it is there , and it is getting annoying.<P>I was just wondering if this is a regular occurence.. I wish there were a subscription fee to the Forum , it would mean one user name and the ability to really ban a person from our othrwise happy fiero community<P>JM ||||reg||1
Z||000001||terryk||07-31-2001||09:06 PM||||Sell products? You mean there is someone following us around into every single fricking post TRYING TO SELL US SOMETHING????!!!!!<P>I agree with you completely. The day-to-day humor is great. Lot's of clever and funny people, but it's starting to become more difficult to sort through the threads. Some thread start out fine and fall apart from there. <P>Yes, I know. I can always leave. Starting to have some merit.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Galen||07-31-2001||09:07 PM||||cliff wont do a 'subscription' fee on here, that would defeat the purpose behind him opening it. I find that what you said is true for the most part yes. I highly doubt one person is behind it though, the posts are too stupid to be only one person. And No, It is not me  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> If I wanna make trouble, I do it with this(or one of my other names hahahaha) name. doobeee<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="purple">Ray</FONT> <FONT COLOR="gray">-</FONT> <FONT COLOR="purple">"With one swift kick the door was off its hinges, and there he saw a god, but it was only a mirror"</FONT>||||reg||1
