Z||000004||Songman||07-31-2001||09:24 PM||||So are you saying that you can't put NOS on a 2M4?<P>Personally I thought that was hilarious..<P>And I only have one forum name because I won't say anything that I can't put my name on. And my real name, my website address, and my primary e-mail are all there...<P>The problem with the forum, and the internet as a whole, is anonymity. People are not held responsible for the things they say and do. They hide behind a screen name. Therefore a 14 year old wimp can become Miss Illinois 96 or even Mr Universe. <P>Instead of talking about how bad it all is, if each one of us will do his or her part to keep it clean, it will get better...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||7
Z||000005||stimpy||07-31-2001||09:25 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Slammed Fiero:<BR><B>It's not even Funny like the posts about putting NOS on a 2m4 , and the guy offering Lisa Bus tickets to his trailer. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, I'm glad you saw some humor in Maniak84's paintmarker-fume induced ramblings. Since I introduced him to the forum, it seems to have opened the door for people with far more finite imaginations to bring their alter-egos to the table with the intent of removing culpability for their fey attempts at humor. For starting this fad I am truly apologetic. Henceforth, Maniak84 will be confined to his room in the single-wide.<P>I don't really know what will stop the insanity and inanity, but feel free to call a moron like you see 'em. I've always enjoyed the sport of pilloring the village idiot. After all, it's just the internet... ||||reg||1
